  "title": "Employee Full & Final Payments — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.PersonnelAdministration.EmployeeFnFPayment",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>The employee's full and final settlement at the end of service.</p><p>An end-of-service payroll run includes employees whose compensation date falls in its period, and needs a settlement whose compensation date equals the run's payment date. The amounts, days and counts on this form are recorded for reference: payroll calculates the settlement itself and does not read them at present.</p><p>When the employee still owes on a loan, the form shows <strong>Settle the open loans in this payment</strong>. Tick it to recover the whole remaining loan balance on the compensation date; without it, an employee with an open loan cannot be settled.</p>",
